# Proxify

## Situation

New client revenue declined 15%.

## Task

Understand why sales efficiency decreased.

## Action

Analyzed lead quality.

Discovered 30% of leads targeted Microsoft skillsets where talent supply was limited.

These leads consumed roughly 60 hours per sales representative while converting at only 0.5%.

Presented findings to leadership.

## Result

Marketing changed how experimental campaigns were run.

Sales focused on higher-converting opportunities.

## Lessons Learned

Lead quality matters more than lead quantity.